# RDX writing

| Folder | Job |
|--------|-----|
| `context/` | How the system works (agents) |
| `specs/` | Numbered feature plans |
| `docs/` | Human + locked product (pricing, copy, ops, OS spec, desk) |

- Do not add new process docs under `docs/`
- Locked pricing/copy/strategy changes need founder OK
- After a spec ships, set it **Done** and update `context/progress-tracker.md`
